" 344 " is key

00:03:33.856 --> 00:03:34.856
"Harry" is the value

00:03:35.282 --> 00:03:37.416
" 567 " is the key &amp; "Neha" is value

00:03:37.441 --> 00:03:43.058
If I add 'Dict' name and it's key here
so I'll get the value

00:03:43.354 --> 00:03:44.407
Which is "Neha"

00:03:45.039 --> 00:03:47.005
How can you access the 'Dict' items?

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:50.519
Absolutely as shown in the example

00:03:50.602 --> 00:03:53.389
" info = {'name': 'Karan', 'age' : 19, 'eligible' : True} "

00:03:53.646 --> 00:03:56.372
